UID: SPARSE-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Canonical dynamic sparse combinations
STATEMENT: >>>
Dynamic real and complex assembly shall combine compiler-owned canonical CSC patterns without a dense scan, preserve structural slots through numerical cancellation, and reject dimension, nonfinite scale/value and overflow violations. Retained dense representations remain bounded references and explicit fallbacks rather than evidence of large-circuit scalability.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Derived campaign requirement. Implementation begins with src/sparse.rs::CscPattern::union and CscMatrix::combine_scaled. Verification: tests/sparse_dynamic.rs. Complex AC assembly and provider adoption require subsequent evidence; checkpoint 384 is pending.
